  "solution": "**__LOGIC__: (Second Number × 5) - 6 = First Number**\n\n**In 59 :13 →**\n\n13 × 5 - 6\n\n= 65 - 6\n\n= 59\n\n**In 99 : 21 →**\n\n21 × 5 - 6\n\n= 105 - 6\n\n= 99\n\nSimilarly-\n\n**In ? : 17 →**\n\n17 × 5 - 6\n\n= 85 - 6\n\n**= 79**\n\nHence, **Option (3)** is the answer.",
